/// requires: db
/// known-gap: vm db_* builtins are not in the VM builtin table
/// known-gap: interp sql_cell_to_value only tries String/i64/i32/f64/bool, so smallint and real fall through to nil
/// smallint and real columns are numbers like integer and double precision.
r | :db_query_one("SELECT 3::smallint AS s, 1.5::real AS r", [])
say(r["s"])
say(r["r"])
